==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 0.67~4 seconds<sup>20f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~2.67 seconds<sup>20f~80f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~6 seconds<sup>20f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you have good [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]]/[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]] units like [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], this stage is considerably easier. [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] are some good choices to deal with the Bore.

With the addition of [[Goggles Cat (Special Cat)|Goggles Cat]], this stage becomes much easier, given his 100% [[Freeze]] chance against [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy invalidates more than half of the enemies in this stage. If you are lucky enough to have him, he can be used to great effect.

