==Trivia==
*Satan's Bedroom's and [[Prince of Darkness]]'s Japanese names can be literally translated as "Demon King's Bedroom" and "Demon King's Mansion" respectively; this may have foreshadowed [[Infernal Tyrant Nyandam]], whose Japanese name is Great Demon King Nyandam.

